    <!-- About (local wording) -->
    <string name="vm_about_intro">YunX is a link parser and high-speed downloader for cloud-drive and video shares. Just paste a link: cloud-drive shares can be browsed and downloaded at full speed, video links can be resolved into direct URLs and original images, and images, videos and audio can all be previewed online.</string>
